Dear Regulatory Affairs Team,

CLASS I RECALL: The FDA has classified the recall of your
device (Vigilyx Gateway GW-5000) as Class I. Immediate
regulatory action is required.

Recall Details:
  FDA Recall Number: Z-2246-2026
  Classification: CLASS I — Most Serious
  Device: Vigilyx Gateway Model GW-5000
  Affected Serials: GW5000-2024-0001 through GW5000-2026-1842
  Units in Distribution: 1,842 (US hospitals)
  Reason: CVE-2026-45912 may allow email filtering bypass
  Risk: Hospital staff may receive phishing emails,
    potentially compromising patient data
  Initiated: October 28, 2026
  Classified: October 30, 2026

Required Actions (Within 48 hours):

  Submit recall documentation through the FDA ESG:

  1. Navigate to the FDA submission portal:
     esubmit.accessdata.fda.gov
     (Type the URL manually. Do NOT click email links.)

  2. Log in with your existing FDA ESG WebTrader account
     (credentials issued during your 510(k) submission —
      sent by registered mail to your address on file)

  3. Submit the following through ESG:
     a. Recall strategy and affected device list
     b. Healthcare provider notification letter (draft)
     c. Corrective Action Plan (CAPA)
     d. Clinical risk assessment

  Important Security Notes:
  FDA will NEVER:
  - Send direct recall submission links via email
  - Require "ESG authentication" through a link
  - Request offline_access or OAuth permissions
  - Ask for clinical trial data or patient records
    through email portals
  - Offer a "Chinese recall channel" for document upload
  - Charge fees for recall submission processing

  All recall submissions are made through esubmit.accessdata.fda.gov
  using your existing ESG WebTrader account. No additional
  authentication is required beyond your standard ESG login.

  For regulatory questions, contact your FDA recall
  coordinator:
  Phone: 1-800-638-2041 (verify at fda.gov)
  Reference: Z-2246-2026

Consequences of Non-Compliance:
  Civil penalties: Up to $25,000 per violation per day
  Device seizure and injunction possible
  Public posting on fda.gov/recalls

Your FDA History:
  510(k) K241842 (2025-06) — Cleared
  Registration REG-884266 — Active
  Class I Recall Z-2246-2026 — PENDING

